jobs.description:
The Senior Java Developer will be part of a vital role in driving the development function forward by taking a forward thinking approach, co-providing ideas around development methods and consistently driving best practice and positive change whilst also providing co-support for any queries regarding any bespoke software issues or bugs. 
 Senior Java Developer role Responsibility; 
-Commits to complete a given work within agreed time limits; 
-Produces code that is tested and compliant to coding principles applied within the project; 
-Aligns closely with Tech Lead/Solution Architect (as applicable); 
-Alerts other team members and project manager of impediments and delays; 
-Troubleshoot issues; 
-Collaborate with team to develop and release new features; 
 Technical skills required for the Senior Java Developer ; 
-Experience in Java, Javascript, XML, JSON, HTML; 
-Knowledge of OO design principles and patterns; 
-Experience with Spring framework and Hibernate ORM; 
-Ability to translate use cases and requirements to working implementation; 
-University education and degree (IT related); 
-Minimum of 5 years experience in a software development function; 
-Enthusiastic coder; 
-Strong analytical and communication skills; 
-Good written and verbal skills in English; 
-Ability to work in a team-environment; 
-Strong attention to detail and thoroughness; 
-Perseverance to solve complex problems; 
-Ability to work in a multicultural and international environment; 
-Demonstrated ability to be a self-starter and learn quickly; 
-Enjoys a high-intensity environment; 
 Senior Java Developer offered? 
-An above market comfortable salary depending on knowledge and skills; 
-Annual bonus; 
-Vacation allowance; 
-27 vacation days; 
-Transportation costs paid; 
-Flexible working hours; 
-And much more! 
